      "diff": "@@ -34,7 +34,7 @@ wsbuglink:18734[].\n \n // The following vulnerabilities have been fixed:\n \n-// * wssalink:2024-06[]\n+// * wssalink:2024-07[]\n // Foo dissector {crash,infinite loop,memory leak}.\n // wsbuglink:xxx[].\n // cveidlink:2024-xxx[].\n@@ -52,6 +52,15 @@ The following bugs have been fixed:\n //* cveidlink:2014-2486[]\n //* Wireshark keeps banging out random chords on your piano and yelling “LIPS LIKE SUGUAR, SUGAR KISSES” because it was funny that one time at a party.\n \n+* Fuzz job issue: fuzz-2024-03-03-7204.pcap wsbuglink:19685[].\n+\n+* Fuzz job issue: randpkt-2024-03-05-8004.pcap wsbuglink:19688[].\n+\n+* '--export-objects' does not work as expected on tshark version later than 3.2.10 wsbuglink:19715[].\n+\n+* Fuzz job issue: fuzz-2024-03-21-7215.pcap wsbuglink:19717[].\n+\n+\n === New and Updated Features\n \n There are no new or updated features in this release.\n@@ -68,9 +77,147 @@ There are no new protocols in this release.\n \n // There are no updated protocols in this release.\n // Add one protocol per line between the -- delimiters.\n-// ag -A1 '(define PSNAME|proto_register_protocol[^_])' $(git diff --name-only v3.6.19.. | ag packet- | sort -u)\n+// ag -A1 '(define PSNAME|proto_register_protocol[^_])' $(git diff --name-only v3.6.22.. | ag packet- | sort -u)\n [commaize]\n --\n+6LoWPAN\n+AFP\n+AllJoyn\n+AMQP\n+ASAP\n+Babel\n+BACnet\n+Banana\n+BEEP\n+Bencode\n+BFCP\n+BGP\n+BT-DHT\n+BT BNEP\n+BT SDP\n+BVLC\n+CIP\n+CMIP\n+CMP\n+COROSYNC/TOTEMSRP\n+COSE\n+CQL\n+CSN.1\n+DAP\n+DICOM\n+DCOM\n+DHCPv6\n+DISP\n+DOCSIS MAC MGMT\n+DOF\n+DVB-S2\n+EDONKEY\n+ErlDP\n+Etch\n+FC-SWILS\n+GNW\n+GLOW\n+GOOSE\n+GQUIC\n+GSM A-bis OML\n+GSUP\n+GTPv2\n+H.223\n+H.225.0\n+H.245\n+H.248\n+H.264\n+H.265\n+HSMS\n+ICMPv6\n+ICQ\n+IEEE1609dot2\n+IPP\n+ISAKMP\n+iSCSI\n+ISIS LSP\n+ISO 7816\n+ISUP\n+ITS\n+JXTA\n+Kafka\n+KINK\n+KNX/IP\n+LDAP\n+LDP\n+5GLI\n+LISP TCP\n+LISP\n+LLRP\n+LwM2M-TLV\n+M2UA\n+M3UA\n+MBIM\n+MMS\n+MONGO\n+MPEG PES\n+MPLS Echo\n+MQ PCF\n+MQTT-SN\n+MSDP\n+MsgPack\n+MS-WSP\n+NAS-5GS\n+CFLOW\n+NETLINK\n+NHRP\n+OpenFlow\n+OpenWire\n+OPSI\n+OSC\n+P22\n+P7\n+PANA\n+PIM\n+ProtoBuf\n+PROXY\n+Q.2931\n+QNET\n+RDP\n+RESP\n+RPL\n+RSL\n+RSVP\n+RTLS\n+RTMPT\n+RTPS\n+S7COMM\n+SCTP\n+SIMULCRYPT\n+SoulSeek\n+SMB2\n+SML\n+SNA\n+Socks\n+SolarEdge\n+SOME/IP\n+SUA\n+TCAP\n+TEAP\n+TFTP\n+Thread\n+TN5250\n+USBHID\n+USBVIDEO\n+VP9\n+WASSP\n+WLCCP\n+WTP\n+X.509IF\n+X.509SAT\n+XML\n+XMPP\n+YAMI\n+Z39.50\n+ZigBee ZCL\n+Gryphon\n+PNIO\n+WiMAX ASN CP\n --\n \n === New and Updated Capture File Support\n@@ -81,13 +228,15 @@ There is no new or updated capture file support in this release.\n // --\n // --\n \n-=== New File Format Decoding Support\n+=== Updated File Format Decoding Support\n \n-There is no new or updated file format support in this release.\n+// There is no updated file format support in this release.\n // Add one file type per line between the -- delimiters.\n-// [commaize]\n-// --\n-// --\n+[commaize]\n+--\n+BLF\n+RBM\n+--\n \n \n // === New and Updated Capture Interfaces support\n",
